        "created_at": "2025-07-12T22:37:44.741173+00:00",
        "notes": "If you haven't won just yet, it's possibly due to your teammates dying just a bit too much.\nIn round 5 I like to go you with clutch transcendences with the power [Soul Control](item_051aca60-1044-4184-bbbf-5aad8b12592a) and item  [Mondatta's Mantra](item_96d3b160-3c50-4768-90e4-c7005c98ce43) \n\nBy using your ultimate with  [Mondatta's Mantra](item_96d3b160-3c50-4768-90e4-c7005c98ce43) just using it on your tank you can get thousands of overhealth which dissipates quite slowly (around 40hps). You can then be very aggressive and get your 100% ultimate charge back very fast.\n\nThis will help you carry your silly suicidal teammates even more. What's very good to know is that you get overhealth from  [Mondatta's Mantra](item_96d3b160-3c50-4768-90e4-c7005c98ce43) even when you only heal yourself. So if you are 1 hp, normally 400, and quickly ult and cancel the ult right away you get 399 overhealth and get 75% of the ultimate back. You can see how much ultimate you will have left on your ultimate ticker.\nThe video showcases the overhealth gain from only healing yourself and also how much ultimate you will have left once you end the ultimate.\n![Image](https://i.imgur.com/QFNkkbo.jpg)",
